## Captured from a real Xumo channel (88884008), lightly trimmed.
## Note what is NOT here: no #EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME, no SCTE-35, no
## EXT-X-DATERANGE. The asset id lives only in the segment path, and the
## playlist offers no wallclock anchor - which is why the timeline is
## interpolated backwards from the live edge. One beacon-wrapped segment is
## kept deliberately: those carry the real URL in a query param plus an
## explicit aid=, and must resolve to the same asset id as their neighbours.
